@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

### Get the authenticated user's organization and assistant
GET {{baseUrl}}/organization/me

### List documents belonging to the authenticated user's organization
GET {{baseUrl}}/organization/me/documents

### Verify organization endpoints reject unauthenticated requests
# Clear the REST Client cookie jar before running these requests to expect 401.
GET {{baseUrl}}/organization/me

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/organization/me/documents
